{"seq":2,"slug":"clean-architecture-frontend","title":"Clean Architecture 前端实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-architecture-patterns/application-structure/clean-architecture-frontend","wordCount":818,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"clean-architecture-前端实践\">Clean Architecture 前端实践</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>Clean Architecture（整洁架构）由 Robert C. Martin 提出，其核心原则是依赖方向单一指向内层——外层可以依赖内层，内层绝不依赖外层。将这一思想应用于前端，意味着业务逻辑（Domain）完全独立于 UI 框架（React/Vue）、状态管理库（Zustand/Redux）和外部服务（API/Storage）。当你需要从 React 迁移到 Vue，或从 REST 切换到 GraphQL 时，核心业务代码无需任何修改。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"同心圆分层模型\">同心圆分层模型</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;Outer: Frameworks and Drivers&quot;&#10;        F1[&quot;React Components&quot;]&#10;        F2[&quot;API Client (fetch/axios)&quot;]&#10;        F3[&quot;LocalStorage / IndexedDB&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;Middle: Interface Adapters&quot;&#10;        A1[&quot;Presenters / ViewModels&quot;]&#10;        A2[&quot;Repository Implementations&quot;]&#10;        A3[&quot;Controllers / Hooks&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;Inner: Business Rules&quot;&#10;        D1[&quot;Entities (domain models)&quot;]&#10;        D2[&quot;Use Cases (application logic)&quot;]&#10;        D3[&quot;Repository Interfaces&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    F1 --&gt; A1&#10;    F2 --&gt; A2&#10;    A1 --&gt; D2&#10;    A2 --&gt; D3&#10;    D2 --&gt; D1\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"Outer: Frameworks and Drivers\"\n        F1[\"React Components\"]\n        F2[\"API Client (fetch/axios)\"]\n        F3[\"LocalStorage / IndexedDB\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"Middle: Interface Adapters\"\n        A1[\"Presenters / ViewModels\"]\n        A2[\"Repository Implementations\"]\n        A3[\"Controllers / Hooks\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"Inner: Business Rules\"\n        D1[\"Entities (domain models)\"]\n        D2[\"Use Cases (application logic)\"]\n        D3[\"Repository Interfaces\"]\n    end\n    F1 --&gt; A1\n    F2 --&gt; A2\n    A1 --&gt; D2\n    A2 --&gt; D3\n    D2 --&gt; D1</pre><p><strong>依赖规则</strong>：箭头只能从外向内指。React 组件依赖 ViewModel，ViewModel 依赖 Use Case，Use Case 依赖 Entity。反之则通过接口（依赖反转）实现。</p>\n<h3 id=\"前端四层架构\">前端四层架构</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Domain（领域层）</td>\n<td>实体、值对象、业务规则</td>\n<td><code>User</code>, <code>Order</code>, <code>validateEmail()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Application（应用层）</td>\n<td>用例、编排逻辑</td>\n<td><code>CreateOrderUseCase</code>, <code>LoginUseCase</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Infrastructure（基础设施层）</td>\n<td>API 客户端、存储实现、第三方 SDK</td>\n<td><code>HttpOrderRepository</code>, <code>LocalStorageCache</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Presentation（表现层）</td>\n<td>UI 组件、状态管理、路由</td>\n<td><code>OrderForm.tsx</code>, <code>useOrderViewModel</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"依赖反转在前端的实现\">依赖反转在前端的实现</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// domain/repositories/OrderRepository.ts - 接口定义（内层）&#10;export interface OrderRepository {&#10;  findById(id: string): Promise&lt;Order&gt;;&#10;  findByUser(userId: string): Promise&lt;Order[]&gt;;&#10;  save(order: Order): Promise&lt;void&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// infrastructure/repositories/HttpOrderRepository.ts - 实现（外层）&#10;import type { OrderRepository } from &#39;@/domain/repositories/OrderRepository&#39;;&#10;import { Order } from &#39;@/domain/entities/Order&#39;;&#10;import { apiClient } from &#39;@/infrastructure/api/client&#39;;&#10;&#10;export class HttpOrderRepository implements OrderRepository {&#10;  async findById(id: string): Promise&lt;Order&gt; {&#10;    const data = await apiClient.get(`/orders/${id}`);&#10;    return Order.fromDTO(data);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  async findByUser(userId: string): Promise&lt;Order[]&gt; {&#10;    const data = await apiClient.get(`/users/${userId}/orders`);&#10;    return data.map(Order.fromDTO);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  async save(order: Order): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;    await apiClient.post(&#39;/orders&#39;, order.toDTO());&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// domain/repositories/OrderRepository.ts - 接口定义（内层）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderRepository</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  findById</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  findByUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">userId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</sp